  <metadata>
    <name>Ouchy – Sauvabelin</name>
    <desc>A city run from the lake at Ouchy up the old town and its covered stairs, past the cathedral, to the lake in the Sauvabelin woods, Lausanne, Switzerland. Demo track: geometry from OpenStreetMap, elevations from AWS Terrain Tiles. Timestamps are synthesized with a constant-effort running model (Minetti's energy cost of running on grades); this is not a real recording.</desc>
    <author>
      <name>GPX Terrain</name>
      <link href="https://github.com/whidrubeld/gpx-terrain"><text>GPX Terrain</text></link>
    </author>
